{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主毕业后从事什么行业？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析：\n\n1. **日主丁火**，生于酉月（金旺），地支两酉一申，金气极重，丁火偏弱。时支巳火为根，但被酉金合绊，力量不足。  \n2. **月干乙木**为偏印，时干乙木亦为偏印，印星透干贴身，主学业、文书、教育之象。  \n3. **年柱庚申**为正财，财星旺而克印，但印星透干且有根（乙木坐酉虽弱，但得时支巳中藏木），说明命主有文化底蕴，但财星干扰，可能从事与教育相关但非纯学术的行业。  \n4. **十神组合**：偏印旺者，多主教师、文化、研究类职业；但财星旺，也可能涉及管理或财务。  \n5. **结合大运**：命主毕业后约在20-30岁走壬午、辛巳运，火运助身，利于发挥才能，但财星透干，可能偏向实际管理或财务类工作。  \n6. **选项分析**：  \n   - A. 中学教师：印星为用，符合教育象，但财星旺，可能不会纯粹做教师。  \n   - B. 公司主管：印星+财星，有管理才能，但主管需较强官杀或比劫，此局官杀不显。  \n   - C. 房屋经纪：财星旺，但需食伤生财，此局食伤（土）不显，且印星制食伤，不太符合。  \n   - D. 会计：财星旺，且印星主计算、文书，会计符合财+印的组合，且酉金为财，巳火为印，有账目处理之象。  \n\n综合判断，**会计**最符合命局中财星旺、印星辅助、且需细致计算的特性。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q35", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6734, "response_id": "06dfab93-9c36-4eee-98a6-9d6e62fcad15", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 432, "total_tokens": 637, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，命主日主为乙木，生于丑月（冬季末），木气衰弱。年柱丙戌，月柱辛丑，时柱庚辰，天干透出辛金、庚金，地支丑土、戌土、辰土重重，土金旺盛，木被克耗严重。乙木在命局中无强根，且被金土围困，代表肝胆、筋骨、神经系统，但此处更需关注五行失衡对健康的影响。\n\n命局中金旺克木，木主肝，肝开窍于目，金克木可能导致眼部问题。同时，土重埋金，金又生水，但水不显，火弱（丙火被辛金合绊），整体气血循环不畅。一岁前（婴儿期）对应大运未起，以月柱辛丑为用，辛金为七杀，丑土为湿土，金寒水冷，木气受冻，易有先天禀赋不足。\n\n在选项中，弱视（斗鸡眼）与肝木受克、目窍不利相关；心脏有孔属火，火弱被水克（但水不显，火弱更甚）；肺炎属金，金旺反成病；地中海贫血属血，与木火生血有关。综合看，金旺克木最直接对应眼部，且婴儿期常见弱视，故最可能为弱视。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4944, "response_id": "265306af-aa12-45ec-a75a-78d068dcac7d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 309, "total_tokens": 526, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。年柱丙戌，丙火透出为用，但戌土为燥土，火有根但不算强。月柱辛丑，辛金七杀克身，丑土湿土晦火，压力较大。时柱庚辰，庚金正官合身，辰土为湿土，进一步耗火。整体来看，命局财星（土）旺而身弱，喜火木为用，但火土过重，财多身弱，难以担财，早年家境一般。年柱丙火为用神，但被月柱辛金合绊，且地支戌土为火库，火气被泄，说明祖上或父母虽有一定能力，但助力有限，家庭经济状况中等偏下。时柱庚辰，官星合身，主后天努力，但早年运势（1-10岁）行己亥大运，亥水冲巳火（年支戌中藏丁火），用神受损，家境不显。综合判断，命主出身应为普通家庭，非大富大贵，也非贫困至极，属于小康偏下水平。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4403, "response_id": "a12e94e1-1467-4105-a3d3-263d9a198d28", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 266, "total_tokens": 483, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，但年支戌土、月日时支丑土重重，财星过旺，木气受耗。时干庚金正官合身，金克木，日主身弱。乙木为阴木，主柔韧、纤细，但全局土金过重，木被压制，故身材不会高大，反而偏矮瘦。土多主肤色偏黄，金多主皮肤偏干，五官因土重而显扁平，缺乏木的秀气。综合判断，命主外貌特征更符合“矮瘦、皮肤蜡黄、五官扁平”的描述。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 2888, "response_id": "344de488-c910-4876-aab7-9fcdf9648161", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 148, "total_tokens": 400, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 124}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q39", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2016年，家中发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。2016年为丙申年，流年天干丙火为伤官，地支申金为正官，与命局年支戌、月日支丑形成申戌丑三会金局，金（官杀）极旺，克制日主乙木。同时，流年丙火伤官透出，与月干辛金七杀相合（丙辛合水），水为印星，但被合化后反而生助官杀，加重压力。\n\n命局中时柱庚辰为正官正财，年柱丙戌为伤官正财，月柱辛丑为七杀偏财。2016年丙申，申金为驿马，且与日支丑（妻宫）相刑，又与年支戌相刑，刑动父母宫（年柱为父母宫）。丙火伤官代表冲动、变动，申金为官杀代表压力、灾祸。综合来看，金旺克木，且刑动父母宫，主父亲有灾。选项中，父亲破产、车祸、离异均有可能，但“严重车祸”更符合金旺（申为金，主刀兵、车祸）且驿马逢冲的象，同时“休养在家”对应木被克而无力行动。婆婆去世虽也涉及长辈，但年柱为父宫，且丙火伤官克庚金正官，更指向父亲事业或身体受损，而非母亲或祖母。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q39", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5579, "response_id": "76cd989d-f221-4cc6-ae68-dc000596909c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 335, "total_tokens": 562, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q40", "domain": "family", "question": "命主父亲现在的身家？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。年柱丙戌，丙火透出为用，但戌土为燥土，火有根但被丑土晦火。月柱辛丑，七杀辛金克身，丑土财星旺。时柱庚辰，正官庚金合身，辰土为湿土，财官过重。整体命局财官旺而身弱，喜木火帮身。\n\n命主父亲看偏财（月干辛金为七杀，偏财看年干丙火，但丙火被辛金合，且戌土为火库，但被丑土冲晦）。年柱丙戌为偏财坐库，但丙火被月干辛金合绊，财星受制。时柱庚辰为正官，官星透出，但财生官，财星不显。综合来看，父亲虽有能力，但财星被合绊，且身弱不担财，财富层次不会极高，但也不至于贫困。结合马来西亚背景，小康或千万级别可能性较大，但亿万身家需强旺财星，此命局财星受制，难以达到亿万。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q40", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5307, "response_id": "045e7b7f-b919-41a9-b4b7-886f3d9da589", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 271, "total_tokens": 490, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
